      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.982,
          "end": 3.66,
          "en": "[Maximilian] Now to make those projects here selectable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.66,
          "end": 6.36,
          "en": "we need two main things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.36,
          "end": 8.79,
          "en": "We need a new component that will be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.79,
          "end": 12.303,
          "en": "for displaying the details of the selected project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.17,
          "end": 15.93,
          "en": "And in addition, we of course must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.93,
          "end": 18.36,
          "en": "that from inside the project sidebar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.36,
          "end": 20.799,
          "en": "we get the information which project was selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.799,
          "end": 23.883,
          "en": "to that to be added component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.71,
          "end": 27.87,
          "en": "Now I'll start with the new component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.87,
          "end": 32.87,
          "en": "I'll name it Selected Project.JSX, that's the file name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.53,
          "end": 35.88,
          "en": "And in there we'll have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.88,
          "end": 40.323,
          "en": "that component function called selected project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.54,
          "end": 45.45,
          "en": "Now here we wanna return a div, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.45,
          "end": 48.811,
          "en": "which then contains a header maybe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.811,
          "end": 53.55,
          "en": "which outputs the main information about that project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.55,
          "end": 56.94,
          "en": "And then below that, later that list of tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.94,
          "end": 58.53,
          "en": "that belongs to the project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.53,
          "end": 60.393,
          "en": "though that will be added later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.35,
          "end": 63.36,
          "en": "For the moment, let's work on this header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.36,
          "end": 66.96,
          "en": "And in this header I then want to have an H1 element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.96,
          "end": 70.17,
          "en": "which outputs the title of that project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.17,
          "end": 72.9,
          "en": "And next to that H one element, I wanna have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.9,
          "end": 76.713,
          "en": "a button that can be used to delete this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.09,
          "end": 81.39,
          "en": "These two elements here should be rendered side by side",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.39,
          "end": 83.46000000000001,
          "en": "therefore I'll group them in a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.46000000000001,
          "end": 86.13,
          "en": "which I can then use together with Flexbox",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.13,
          "end": 89.431,
          "en": "to position these elements next to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.431,
          "end": 92.58,
          "en": "Because still in the header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.58,
          "end": 95.85,
          "en": "but below this title button combination,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.85,
          "end": 99.45,
          "en": "I wanna output a paragraph where I output the date",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.45,
          "end": 103.68,
          "en": "of that project and below that, the description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.68,
          "end": 105.003,
          "en": "in another paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.89,
          "end": 109.08,
          "en": "Now of course all that data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.08,
          "end": 113.46000000000001,
          "en": "should be received here as props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.46000000000001,
          "end": 117.3,
          "en": "So here I expect to get the project prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.3,
          "end": 119.872,
          "en": "which should be such a project object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.872,
          "end": 124.53,
          "en": "so that here we can output project title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.53,
          "end": 127.41,
          "en": "Then here the project date,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.41,
          "end": 131.28,
          "en": "though I wanna format it to make it more human readable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.28,
          "end": 135.933,
          "en": "And for that I'll add a new constant, format it date,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 137.82,
          "end": 139.95,
          "en": "where I'll create a new date object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.95,
          "end": 144.813,
          "en": "to which I pass my due date stored in the project object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.13,
          "end": 148.47,
          "en": "And on that built in date object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 148.47,
          "end": 150.48,
          "en": "which is provided by the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 150.48,
          "end": 155.48,
          "en": "you can call two locale date string to format that date.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 157.17000000000002,
          "end": 160.56,
          "en": "And here I'll format it according to US standards.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 160.56,
          "end": 164.22,
          "en": "And you can pass a configuration object as a second argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 164.22,
          "end": 167.04,
          "en": "to low locale date string, which allows you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 167.04,
          "end": 171.48,
          "en": "to control how the year should be displayed, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 171.48,
          "end": 173.31,
          "en": "if you want to display two digits",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 173.31,
          "end": 176.16,
          "en": "or the full number, you can also control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 176.16,
          "end": 178.56,
          "en": "whether the month should be displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 178.56,
          "end": 181.44,
          "en": "in a long form, short form, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 181.44,
          "end": 183.394,
          "en": "And here I'll go for the short form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 183.394,
          "end": 186.633,
          "en": "and for the day I'll again choose numeric.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 188.52,
          "end": 190.62,
          "en": "And definitely feel free to play around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 190.62,
          "end": 193.083,
          "en": "with this object and this method here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 194.1,
          "end": 196.62,
          "en": "But with that we have a formatted date,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 196.62,
          "end": 198.423,
          "en": "which I'll output down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 199.68,
          "end": 201.87,
          "en": "And of course for the description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 201.87,
          "end": 205.503,
          "en": "the project description should be output like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 207.09,
          "end": 210.12,
          "en": "And then we also need some styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 210.12,
          "end": 213.81,
          "en": "And I'll start with that div that wraps everything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 213.81,
          "end": 217.92000000000002,
          "en": "Here, I'll set a custom width of 35 rem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 217.92000000000002,
          "end": 222.903,
          "en": "like this, and add some margin to the top.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 224.28,
          "end": 229.28,
          "en": "Next on this header here, I'll add a padding to the bottom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 229.74,
          "end": 234.74,
          "en": "of one rem with PB4, a margin to the bottom of one rem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 236.04,
          "end": 241.04,
          "en": "with MB4, border to the bottom of two pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 243.48,
          "end": 245.19,
          "en": "And give that border a color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 245.19,
          "end": 249.603,
          "en": "of that light gray color here, border stone 300.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 251.13,
          "end": 253.74,
          "en": "And then on this diff here, I'll add a class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 253.74,
          "end": 257.142,
          "en": "which makes sure that tidal and button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 257.142,
          "end": 259.23,
          "en": "get positioned next to each other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 259.23,
          "end": 263.25,
          "en": "by adding flex here items center",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 263.25,
          "end": 265.95,
          "en": "and justify between to add some spacing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 265.95,
          "end": 268.14300000000003,
          "en": "between the title and the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 269.52,
          "end": 274.52,
          "en": "And then here for the title, I'll add text 3XL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 274.98,
          "end": 277.353,
          "en": "as a value to make this text pretty big,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 278.37,
          "end": 281.64,
          "en": "add font bold to make it bold and give it a color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 281.64,
          "end": 285.33299999999997,
          "en": "of Text Stone 600 and add some margin to the bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 286.68,
          "end": 291.68,
          "en": "For the button, I'll add a text color of text stone 600",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 293.22,
          "end": 297.27,
          "en": "and then a hover text color of text stone 950,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 297.27,
          "end": 299.313,
          "en": "so a darker color in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 300.556,
          "end": 304.77,
          "en": "Now for the paragraphs here, for the first paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 304.77,
          "end": 308.73,
          "en": "I'll give this margin bottom four class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 308.73,
          "end": 312.873,
          "en": "and text-stone-400 for the text color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 314.58,
          "end": 318.15,
          "en": "And then for the second paragraph here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 318.15,
          "end": 323.15,
          "en": "I'll choose text stone 600, so a darker gray color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 323.97,
          "end": 328.97,
          "en": "And also add white space pre wrap to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 329.22,
          "end": 332.31,
          "en": "that line breaks that are added here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 332.31,
          "end": 337.31,
          "en": "in this description field are kept and are not removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 338.854,
          "end": 342.273,
          "en": "So that's what white space pre wrap will do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 344.79,
          "end": 348.183,
          "en": "And with that, this shouldn't look too bad.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 349.89,
          "end": 352.44,
          "en": "Now to see it in action, we have to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 352.44,
          "end": 355.503,
          "en": "that projects can be selected in that sidebar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 357.09000000000003,
          "end": 359.4,
          "en": "And for that of course, we must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 359.4,
          "end": 360.96,
          "en": "that this button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 360.96,
          "end": 363.243,
          "en": "changes some state in the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 364.68,
          "end": 366.06,
          "en": "So in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 366.06,
          "end": 368.85,
          "en": "we want to add yet another new function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 368.85,
          "end": 373.653,
          "en": "which should be called Handle Select Project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 375.51,
          "end": 379.503,
          "en": "where I expect to get the project ID as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 381.06,
          "end": 383.16,
          "en": "And where I then wanna update",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 383.16,
          "end": 388.16,
          "en": "the state as we're doing it here in handle start at project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 388.5,
          "end": 390.78,
          "en": "But where the selected project ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 390.78,
          "end": 393.39,
          "en": "now of course should be set to this ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 393.39,
          "end": 394.94,
          "en": "which we're getting as a input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 396.57,
          "end": 398.67,
          "en": "And now Handle Select Project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 398.67,
          "end": 403.67,
          "en": "should be passed to this project's sidebar component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 405.78,
          "end": 410.74,
          "en": "So here, I'll add another new prop on select project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 412.35,
          "end": 414.87,
          "en": "And the value should be this newly added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 414.87,
          "end": 417.963,
          "en": "handle select project function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 420.48,
          "end": 425.31,
          "en": "Inside of the project sidebar, we now have to extract this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 425.31,
          "end": 427.71,
          "en": "on select project prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 427.71,
          "end": 431.71,
          "en": "From the incoming props here with destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 433.551,
          "end": 437.223,
          "en": "and connect it to this button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 438.66,
          "end": 440.283,
          "en": "So here on this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 441.12,
          "end": 442.95,
          "en": "I'll break this across multiple lines",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 442.95,
          "end": 444.55,
          "en": "to make it a bit easier to read,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 448.71,
          "end": 451.293,
          "en": "on select project prop as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 453.42,
          "end": 456.69,
          "en": "Now in addition here I also wanna highlight",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 456.69,
          "end": 459.42,
          "en": "which project was selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 459.42,
          "end": 462.18,
          "en": "And therefore I actually also want to get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 462.18,
          "end": 465.28,
          "en": "the selected project ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 466.17,
          "end": 468.21,
          "en": "as a prop in addition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 468.21,
          "end": 470.83,
          "en": "to this onselect project prop we just added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 472.29,
          "end": 475.69,
          "en": "because we can now use this prop, which should contain",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 477.496,
          "end": 478.86,
          "en": "the ID of the project that was selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 478.86,
          "end": 480.543,
          "en": "to highlight a certain button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 482.49,
          "end": 484.86,
          "en": "Now to do this, I'll change this code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 484.86,
          "end": 486.3,
          "en": "in this map method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 486.3,
          "end": 490.44,
          "en": "to move away from this very short inline notation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 490.44,
          "end": 494.68,
          "en": "and instead add these opening and closing curly braces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 496.47,
          "end": 501.47,
          "en": "and return this list item here like that so that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
